            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Dialogue 2",
            "steps": [
              {
                "npc": "Hmm, you look like a tasty specimen - in fact I'm quite peckish right now. You can either go to the mines or give me a bite; what do you say?"
              },
              {
                "type": "jump",
                "reference": "continue",
                "id": "kiLa6R"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Dialogue 3",
            "steps": [
              {
                "npc": "Ooh, a meat sack... I could just do with a snack. What's it to be: some time in the mines or do I get a bite?"
